codex
The rail is the source of the unstable layout: the visual round moved it to grid row 1 but left it spanning only two rows, ending before the article body. Its hydrating sticky content was therefore resizing the hero and header tracks during an interaction. I’m extending its span through the body track and adding a deliberate scene scroll offset for the fixed header.
